    { "Allows controller navigation of the port menu (Settings, Enhancements,...)\nCAUTION: This will disable game inputs while the menu is visible.\n\nD-pad to move between items, A to select, B to move up in scope.", "允许用控制器导航端口菜单（设置、增强功能等）\n注意：菜单可见时会禁用游戏输入。\n\n用十字键在各项间移动，A 键选择，B 键返回上一级。" },
    { "Allows cycling between different arrow types (Normal, Fire, Ice, Light) while aiming the bow. ", "允许在瞄准弓时在不同箭头类型（普通、火、冰、光）间循环。" },
    { "Allows dogs to follow you anywhere you go, even if you leave the Market.", "允许狗跟随你到任何地方，即使离开市场。" },
