    { "Disable the geometry wobble and camera distortion inside Jabu.", "禁用贾布内部的几何晃动和相机扭曲。" },
    { "Disabled", "已禁用" },
    { "Disabled: Paths vanish more the higher the resolution (Z-Fighting is based on resolution).\n", "已禁用：分辨率越高，路径消失越多（Z 冲突基于分辨率）。\n" },
    { "Disables 2D pre-rendered backgrounds. Enable this when using a mod that ", "禁用 2D 预渲染背景。使用修改此类背景的模组时启用" },
    { "Disables Black Bar Letterboxes during cutscenes and Z-Targeting. NOTE: There may be minor visual ", "禁用过场动画和 Z 瞄准时的黑边信箱。注意：可能会有轻微的视觉" },
    { "Disables Grottos rotating with the Camera. To be used in conjuction with mods that want to ", "禁用洞窟随相机旋转。与需要此功能的模组配合使用" },
    { "Disables Heart Drops, but not Heart Placements, like from a Deku Scrub running off.\n", "禁用心形掉落，但不禁用心形放置，例如德库树精逃跑时。\n" },
    { "Disables Random Drops, except from the Goron Pot, Dampe, and Bosses.", "禁用随机掉落，哥隆壶、达姆佩和 Boss 除外。" },
    { "Disables bombs always rotating to face the camera. To be used in conjunction with mods that want to ", "禁用炸弹始终旋转面向相机。与需要此功能的模组配合使用" },
    { "Disables sandstorm effect in Haunted Wasteland.", "禁用鬼魅荒野的沙暴效果。" },
    { "Disables the Beating Animation of the Hearts on the HUD.", "禁用心形 HUD 的跳动动画。" },
    { "Disables the automatic re-centering of the camera when idle.", "禁用空闲时相机的自动重新居中。" },
    { "Disables the fixed camera in maps that use 2D pre-rendered backgrounds. Enable this when using a mod ", "在使用 2D 预渲染背景的地图中禁用固定相机。使用此类模组时启用" },
    { "Disables the sword trail effect when swinging Link's sword. Useful when ", "禁用挥动林克之剑时的剑光轨迹效果。适用于" },
    { "Disables the white screen flash on enemy kill.", "禁用击杀敌人时的白屏闪光。" },
    { "Disables warning text when you don't have on the Goron/Zora Tunic ", "当未穿着哥隆/佐拉外衣时禁用警告文本" },
    { "Displays a \"Mystery Item\" model in place of any freestanding/GS/shop items that were shuffled, ", "为任何被洗牌的静止/黄金骷髅/商店物品显示“神秘物品”模型，" },
    { "Displays a test notification.", "显示一个测试通知。" },
    { "Displays a tick in the top center of the screen to help with glitch line-ups in SoH, since traditional ", "在屏幕顶部中央显示一个刻度，以帮助在 SoH 中对齐故障，因为传统的" },
    { "Displays an icon and plays a sound when Stone of Agony should be activated, for those without rumble.", "当痛苦之石应被激活时显示图标并播放声音，供没有震动的玩家使用。" },
    { "Displays the Search menu as a sidebar entry in Settings instead of in the header.", "将搜索菜单显示为设置中的侧边栏条目，而非标题栏。" },
