    { "Draws the Wind Waker sky only on the left half of the screen, leaving the original sky ", "仅将风之杖天空绘制在屏幕左半部分，保留原始天空" },
    { "Draws the actual 3D shadow volume translucently so you can see its shape: black top/bottom caps, ", "半透明地绘制实际的 3D 阴影体积，以便查看其形状：黑色顶/底盖，" },
