    { "Fixes Dampé going backwards in certain circumstances when the player is going backwards.", "修复玩家倒退时达姆佩在某些情况倒退。" },
    { "Fixes Darunia's dancing speed so he dances to the beat of Saria's Song, like in the Original Game.", "修复达鲁尼亚的跳舞速度，使其随萨莉亚之歌的节拍跳舞，如同原版游戏。" },
    { "Fixes Link's eyes being open in the opening cutscene when he is supposed to be sleeping.", "修复林克在开场过场动画中本应睡着却睁眼。" },
    { "Fixes a bug where the Gravedigging Tour Heart Piece disappears if the area reloads.", "修复掘墓之旅心之碎片在区域重新加载时消失的错误。" },
    { "Fixes authentic out of bounds texture reads, instead loading textures with the correct size.", "修复原版越界纹理读取，改为以正确大小加载纹理。" },
    { "Fixes camera getting stuck on collision when standing still. Also fixes slight shift ", "修复站立不动时相机卡在碰撞上的问题。同时修复轻微移动" },
