    { "Fixes camera swing rate when the player falls off a ledge and the camera ", "修复玩家从壁架掉落时相机摆动速率" },
    { "Fixes kokiri animation state to match their text state when getting ", "修复科克里动画状态以匹配其文本状态" },
    { "Fixes one Zora's dialogue giving a hint about bringing Ruto's Letter to King Zora to properly occur ", "修复某佐拉对话中关于带露托的信给佐拉王的提示未能正确触发的错误" },
    { "Fixes the Broken Giant's Knife flag not being reset when Medigoron fixes it.", "修复巨人之刀损坏标志在梅迪戈隆修复时未重置。" },
    { "Fixes the bushes to drop items correctly rather than spawning undefined items.", "修复灌木以正确掉落物品，而非生成未定义物品。" },
    { "Fixes the two raised floor switches, the one in Forest Temple Basement and the one at the top of Fire ", "修复两个抬升地板开关，森林神殿地下室和火之神殿顶部" },
