    { "Make Anubis Fireballs do Fire damage when reflected back at them with the Mirror Shield.", "用镜像盾反射时，使阿努比斯火球造成火焰伤害。" },
    { "Make Deku Nuts explode Bombs, similar to how they interact with Bombchus. ", "让代库坚果引爆炸弹，类似于它们与炸弹鼠的互动。" },
    { "Make crouch stabbing always do the same damage as a regular slash.", "使蹲刺始终造成与普通挥砍相同的伤害。" },
    { "Make the Megaton Hammer's crouch stab able to destroy rocks without first swinging it normally.", "使兆吨锤的蹲刺能在不先正常挥舞的情况下摧毁岩石。" },
    { "Makes Dampe appear anytime during the night, not just his usual working hours.", "使达姆佩在夜间任何时间出现，而非仅在其正常工作时间。" },
    { "Makes Gold Skulltulas come out of bean patches faster after bugs dig into center.", "使黄金骷髅更快从豆荚中钻出。" },
    { "Makes L and R switch pages like on the GameCube. Z opens the Debug Menu instead.", "使 L 和 R 像 GameCube 上一样切换页面。Z 改为打开调试菜单。" },
    { "Makes Link always kick the chest to open it, instead of doing the longer ", "使林克总是踢开宝箱来打开它，而非做更长的" },
    { "Makes a lit, held Deku stick a real light source at its burning tip (it isn't in vanilla). Like a ", "使点燃的、手持的代库木棒在其燃烧尖端成为真实光源（原版中不是）。像" },
    { "Makes all equipment visible, regardless of age.", "使所有装备可见，不受年龄限制。" },
    { "Makes every surface in the game climbable.", "使游戏中所有表面都可攀爬。" },
    { "Makes every surface in the game hookshotable.", "使游戏中所有表面都可钩。" },
    { "Makes every tunic have the effects of every other tunic.", "使每件外衣都具有其他外衣的效果。" },
    { "Makes non-Navi fairies emit light (they don't in vanilla): the fairies that drift around places ", "使非娜薇精灵发光（原版中不会）：在各地飘荡的精灵" },
    { "Makes the Hookshot Reticle use a different color when aiming at hookshotable collision.", "使钩爪准星在瞄准可钩碰撞时使用不同颜色。" },
