    { "Remove this button from the combination", "从组合中移除此按钮" },
    { "Removes tearing, but clamps your max FPS to your displays refresh rate.", "消除画面撕裂，但将最大 FPS 限制为显示器刷新率。" },
    { "Removes the Dungeon Entrance icon on the top-left corner of the screen when no dungeon is present on the ", "移除屏幕左上角的地牢入口图标（当该区域没有地牢时）。" },
    { "Removes the Input Requirement on Text boxes after defeating Ganon, allowing the Credits ", "移除击败加农后文本框的输入要求，允许过场字幕" },
    { "Removes the cap of 3 active explosives being deployed at once.", "移除同时部署 3 个活跃炸药的 cap。" },
    { "Removes the timer to play back the song.", "移除演奏歌曲的计时器。" },
    { "Render Distance: %d", "渲染距离：%d" },
    { "Renderer API (Needs reload)", "渲染器 API（需重新加载）" },
    { "Renders Gauntlets when using the Bow and Hookshot like in OoT3D.", "像 OoT3D 中一样，在使用弓和钩爪时渲染臂铠。" },
    { "Renders a health bar for Enemies when Z-Targeted.", "在 Z 瞄准时为敌人渲染生命条。" },
    { "Renders every cel-shaded object as flat white on the lit side and flat black in shadow (the ", "将每个卡通渲染物体渲染为受光面纯白、阴影中纯黑（" },
    { "Replace Navi's overworld quest hints with rando-related gameplay hints.", "用随机化相关的游戏玩法提示替换娜薇的地面任务提示。" },
    { "Replace Sky Texture", "替换天空纹理" },
    { "Replaces most 2D items and projectiles on the overworld with their equivalent 3D models.", "用等效的 3D 模型替换地面上的大多数 2D 物品和抛射物。" },
    { "Replaces the game's fast, jagged per-frame torch/flame flicker with a slow, organic Wind Waker ", "将游戏快速、锯齿状的逐帧火把/火焰闪烁替换为缓慢、自然的风之杖" },
    { "Replaces the overworld sky with a Wind Waker-style one: a gradient sky dome, drifting puffy ", "用风之杖风格的天空替换地面天空：渐变穹顶、飘逸蓬松" },
    { "Replaces the sky texture with a smooth Wind Waker-style gradient, fading from a hazy horizon ", "用平滑的风之杖风格渐变替换天空纹理，从朦胧的地平线" },
    { "Replaces the vanilla actor shadows with a shape-based drop shadow for each actor (Link, NPCs, ", "用基于形状的下落阴影替换原版角色阴影，为每个角色（林克、NPC、" },
    { "Reset", "重置" },
    { "Reset All to Defaults", "全部重置为默认" },
    { "Reset Button Combination:", "重置按钮组合：" },
    { "Resets all the Actor Shadows sliders below to their default values.", "将下方所有角色阴影滑块重置为默认值。" },
    { "Resets all the Cel Shading sliders below to their default values.", "将下方所有卡通渲染滑块重置为默认值。" },
    { "Resets the Navi timer on scene change. If you have already talked to her, ", "在场景切换时重置娜薇计时器。如果你已经和她交谈过，" },
    { "Resets this color to its default value", "将此颜色重置为默认值" },
    { "Resource logging", "资源日志" },
    { "Respawn with Full Health instead of 3 hearts.", "以满生命重生，而非 3 颗心。" },
    { "Restore Old Gold Skulltula Cutscene", "还原旧版黄金骷髅过场动画" },
    { "Restore a bug from NTSC 1.0 that allows bypassing Bongo Bongo's intro cutscene to quickly kill him.", "还原 NTSC 1.0 中的错误，允许跳过邦戈邦戈的入场过场动画以快速击杀他。" },
    { "Restore a bug from NTSC 1.0 that allows casting the Fishing Rod while using the Hover Boots.", "还原 NTSC 1.0 中的错误，允许在使用悬浮靴时投掷钓鱼竿。" },
    { "Restore a bug from NTSC 1.0 that allows putting away an item without an animation and performing ", "还原 NTSC 1.0 中的错误，允许无动画收起物品并执行" },
    { "Restore pre-release behavior where defeating a Gold Skulltula will play a cutscene showing it die.", "还原发布前的行为，击败黄金骷髅时会播放其死亡的过场动画。" },
    { "Restore the original red blood from NTSC 1.0/1.1. Disable for Green blood.", "还原 NTSC 1.0/1.1 中的原版红色血液。禁用则为绿色血液。" },
    { "Restores N64 Weird Frames allowing weirdshots and weirdslides to behave the same as N64.", "还原 N64 怪异帧，使怪异截图和怪异滑行与 N64 表现相同。" },
    { "Restores NTSC 1.0 behavior where Link jumps over grave holes and grabs the ledges.", "还原 NTSC 1.0 中林克跳过坟墓洞并抓住壁架的行为。" },
    { "Restores a bug from NTSC 1.0/1.1 that allows you to obtain the eyeball frog from King Zora ", "还原 NTSC 1.0/1.1 中的错误，允许你从佐拉王处获得眼球蛙" },
    { "Restores an unfinished feature to pulsate the boss room icon when you are in the boss room.", "还原一个未完成的功能，当你在 Boss 房间时脉动 Boss 房间图标。" },
    { "Restores the wider range of certain shutter doors from NTSC 1.0.\n", "还原 NTSC 1.0 中某些卷帘门的更宽范围。\n" },
    { "Reworked Targeting", "重做的瞄准" },
    { "Reworks targeting functionality\n", "重做瞄准功能\n" },
