    { "Texture Filter (Needs reload)", "纹理过滤（需重新加载）" },
    { "The Kokiri are mystical beings that fade into view when approached. Enabling this will remove their ", "科克里是神秘的存在，靠近时淡入视野。启用此项将移除他们的" },
    { "The Pond Owner will not ask to confirm if you want to keep a smaller Fish.", "池塘主人不会询问你是否要保留较小的鱼。" },
    { "The ammunition at the start of the Shooting Gallery minigame as Adult.", "成人时射击场小游戏开始时的弹药。" },
    { "The ammunition at the start of the Shooting Gallery minigame as Child.", "儿童时射击场小游戏开始时的弹药。" },
    { "The amount of cuccos needed to receive bottle from Anju the Cucco Lady.", "从养鸡妇安茹处获得瓶子所需的公鸡数量。" },
    { "The crawlspace into Hyrule Castle goes straight to Zelda, skipping the guards.", "通往海拉尔城的爬行空间直达塞尔达，跳过守卫。" },
    { "The default response to Kaepora Gaebora is always that you understood what he said.", "对卡波拉·盖波拉的默认回应总是你理解了他的话。" },
    { "The log level determines which messages are printed to the console.", "日志级别决定打印到控制台的消息。" },
    { "The minimum weight for the unique Fishing Reward as a child.", "儿童时独特钓鱼奖励的最小重量。" },
    { "The minimum weight for the unique fishing reward as an adult.", "成人时独特钓鱼奖励的最小重量。" },
    { "The number of Bombchus available at the start of the Bombchu Bowling minigame.", "炸弹鼠保龄球小游戏开始时可用的炸弹鼠数量。" },
    { "The size of the item when it is picked up.", "物品被拾起时的大小。" },
    { "The skybox in the background of the File Select screen will go through the ", "文件选择屏幕背景中的天空盒将经历" },
    { "The time between groups of Leevers spawning.", "利弗群体生成之间的时间。" },
    { "These are NOT like emulator states. They do not save your game progress ", "这些与模拟器状态不同。它们不保存你的游戏进度" },
    { "These enhancements are only useful in the Randomizer mode but do not affect the randomizer logic.", "这些增强仅在随机化模式中有用，但不影响随机化逻辑。" },
    { "This allows you to advance through the game one frame at a time on command. ", "这允许你按命令逐帧推进游戏。" },
    { "This allows you to put up for shield with any two-handed weapon in hand except for Deku Sticks.", "这允许你手持任何双手武器时举起盾牌，代库木棒除外。" },
    { "This setting is disabled because: \n", "此设置已禁用，因为：\n" },
