    { "Turns Bunny Hood Invisible while still maintaining its effects.", "使兔帽隐形，同时保持其效果。" },
    { "Turns off the Level of Detail setting, making models use their Higher-Poly variants at any distance.", "关闭细节层次设置，使模型在任何距离使用高多边形变体。" },
    { "Turns on OoT Beta Quest. *WARNING*: This will reset your game!", "开启 OoT 测试任务。*警告*：这将重置你的游戏！" },
