    { "Warping", "传送中" },
    { "Wearing the Bunny Hood grants a speed and jump boost like in Majora's Mask.\n", "佩戴兔帽获得类似《玛祖拉的面具》中的速度和跳跃加成。\n" },
    { "When Medallions are collected, the Medallion imprints around the Master Sword Pedestal in the Temple ", "当收集到勋章时，勋章印记会出现在时之庙大师之剑基座周围" },
    { "When a line is stable, guarantee bite. Otherwise use Default logic.", "当鱼线稳定时保证咬钩。否则使用默认逻辑。" },
    { "When loading a save, places Link at the last entrance he went through.\n", "加载存档时，将林克放在他通过的最后一个入口。\n" },
    { "When obtaining Rupees, randomize what the Rupee is called in the textbox.", "获得卢比时，随机化文本框中卢比的称呼。" },
    { "When shuffling boss souls, they'll appear as a simpler model instead of showing the boss' models.", "洗牌 Boss 灵魂时，它们会显示为更简单的模型，而非显示 Boss 的模型。" },
    { "When viewers spawn enemies, the enemy will have a name tag above them with the viewer's name.", "当观众生成敌人时，敌人在其上方会有带观众名字的名称标签。" },
    { "When you lose 4 quarters of a heart you will permanently lose that Heart Container.\n\n", "当你失去一颗心的 4 个四分之一时，你将永久失去该心之容器。\n\n" },
    { "Where the dark-to-light transition sits. Higher = more of the surface ", "明暗过渡的位置。越高 = 表面更多" },
    { "Which corner of the screen notifications appear in.", "通知出现在屏幕的哪个角落。" },
    { "Wide Door Ranges", "宽门范围" },
    { "Widescreen (16:9)", "宽屏（16:9）" },
    { "Widescreen Actor Culling", "宽屏角色剔除" },
    { "Width of the transition band. Low = a hard cel edge; high = a softer ", "过渡带的宽度。低 = 硬卡通边缘；高 = 更柔和" },
    { "Wind Waker Style", "风之杖风格" },
    { "Wind Waker's white wind streaks curling through the sky — occasionally pulling a full ", "风之杖的白色风纹在天空中卷曲，偶尔拉出完整的" },
