    { "Health\n- Red when health critical (13-20% depending on max health)\n- Yellow when health < 40%. Green otherwise.\n\nTunics: colors will mirror currently equipped tunic, whether original or the current values in Cosmetics Editor.\n\nCustom: single, solid color", "血量\n- 血量危急时（根据最大血量介于 13-20%）为红色\n- 血量低于 40% 时为黄色，否则为绿色。\n\n外衣：颜色会映射当前装备的外衣颜色，无论原版还是外观编辑器中的当前值。\n\n自定义：单一纯色" },

